<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP OPEN MARKET OPERATIONS UNDERSUBSCIBED.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP OPEN MARKET OPERATIONS UNDERSUBSCIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid to place 10 million zlotys, in nominal terms, at the National Bank of Poland's reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction against a 100 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>They also bid for 22 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills against a 200 million zloty central bank offer.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
